Z||000000||JohnF||10-08-2001||08:39 PM||||Hey ya,ll - A great North Central Texas (and surrounding states "get-together").  Saturday, 13 October, 2001.  All Fieros (and Fiero lovers) are invited.  A great place to meet the PFF people.<P>Southlake Town Center, Saturday, 13 Oct.  3:00 to 7:00 p.m. A get-together with  NO prizes, No judges, NO entry fee.  Just show up for the get-together.<P>To get there, go North on Hwy 114 to Grapevine, Tex., then West off Hwy 114 to Southlake Blvd/Wall Street.  Southlake Blvd to Southlake Town Center (about 3 miles on the right).  Gazebo and parking are reserved for this happening!  Just NE of the North runway of Dallas/Ft. Worth airport.  Shopping/restaurants/sight seeing and reserved parking right on the highway!<P>Bring your camera and favorive beverage for 4 hours of fun!<P>North Texas - Here we are!<P> <IMG SRC="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/View?u=1578096&a=12001112&p=54242256&Sequence=0"> ||||reg||10
